Z||000000||turbo86se||06-14-2000||09:06 PM||||<BR>Ok! It's almost time to head up to beautiful historic Williamsburg for FOSEVA's Fiero show! In case you don't know the Fiero show is June 15-18th. Lots and lots of Fieros are expected, should be lots of fun, and a good chance to meet some great people.<P>There was some talk of some Carolina Fiero owners making the trip, but I haven't heard anything in a while.  I'm leaving early Friday morning. Around 5am with a friend of mine in a white 88 coupe.  If you'd like to join us in the trek to VA, LMK and I'll give you my cell number, so maybe we can hook up on I-95 or somewhere.  <P>Webtv is portable, so I'll have it set up in my hotel room.  <P>Hope to see lots of you guys up there!!||||reg||2
